# Hidden directories and files: the virtual environment, git's own data, caches
# and tool settings. Only the workflow is needed, since a test reads it.
.*
!.github
# What a build or a run writes. The results file stays: the suite reads it.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
build
dist
site
allure-results*
allure-report
test-results
results/*
!results/a11y.json
